    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899750/extras/4656274bd0c7dcf43edc08896ca70405.poster.avif?t=1729059569\" width=600 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899750/extras/4656274bd0c7dcf43edc08896ca70405.webm?t=1729059569\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899750/extras/4656274bd0c7dcf43edc08896ca70405.mp4?t=1729059569\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Embark on an otherworldly adventure in 'My Boyfriend is a Martian,' a visual novel that combines stunning artwork with a gripping storyline. Join Katie, an ordinary girl with an extraordinary love life, as she navigates the complexities of interstellar romance. As the tale unfolds, immerse yourself in lush landscapes and meet intriguing characters from distant planets. Will Katie's heart be conquered by her extraterrestrial paramour?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Sensual Scenarios: Indulge in titillating encounters and steamy moments as Katie navigates the pleasures and pitfalls of dating a Martian. With tantalizing scenes that'll leave you blushing and laughing in equal measure, &quot;My Boyfriend is a Martian&quot; promises an unforgettable journey of pleasure and enjoyment.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899750/extras/500b8ed18ca950b74a8fec9c0534e360.poster.avif?t=1729059569\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899750/extras/500b8ed18ca950b74a8fec9c0534e360.webm?t=1729059569\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899750/extras/500b8ed18ca950b74a8fec9c0534e360.mp4?t=1729059569\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br></li><li>Interstellar Intimacy: Explore the depths of intimacy as Katie's relationship with her Martian beau blossoms, experience a love that transcends planetary boundaries.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899750/extras/03e76754177711cf726bd617300a0bf5.poster.avif?t=1729059569\" width=600 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899750/extras/03e76754177711cf726bd617300a0bf5.webm?t=1729059569\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899750/extras/03e76754177711cf726bd617300a0bf5.mp4?t=1729059569\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br></li><li>Satisfaction: Whether you're seeking laughter, romance, or a bit of both, &quot;My Boyfriend is a Martian&quot; offers a delightful blend of gratifying moments of enjoyment.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899750/extras/5dcef6403d5d493b04c3b6bcb945eebe.poster.avif?t=1729059569\" width=600 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899750/extras/5dcef6403d5d493b04c3b6bcb945eebe.webm?t=1729059569\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899750/extras/5dcef6403d5d493b04c3b6bcb945eebe.mp4?t=1729059569\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br></li><li>Visually Stunning Scenes: Immerse yourself in breathtaking artwork that captures the beauty and wonder, every scene is a visual feast designed to enhance your enjoyment of Katie's cosmic escapades.</li></ul>",
